Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.49,0:41:09.09,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k68}Yǎn{\k96}qián {\k74}fēi{\k42}yáng{\k41}zhe {\k67}yī{\k74}gè {\k98}gè{\k0}
