Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.06,0:41:27.37,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,678.667)}desolate are the beacon fires and border towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.37,0:41:35.21,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,678.667)}O, Years! You cannot take away
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.26,0:41:34.87,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k62}Suì{\k93}yuè {\k99}a {\k38}nǐ {\k127}dài {\k33}bù {\k77}zǒu, {\k30}nà {\k40}yī {\k39}chuàn {\k23}chuàn{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.01,0:41:39.81,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k32}shú{\k38}xī {\k83}di {\k120}xìng{\k207}míng
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.21,0:41:39.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,678.667)}that succession of familiar lives.
