Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.85,0:42:04.93,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,678.667)}reshaping space and time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.93,0:42:11.25,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,678.667)}Meeting and parting are always destined,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.99,0:42:10.69,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k37}Jù {\k41}sàn {\k42}jiē {\k54}shì {\k80}yuán {\k316}a{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.25,0:42:17.33,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,678.667)}separation and reunion always weigh on our hearts.
